{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538290/extras/MirrorCropped.gif?t=1744207892\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience True Paranoia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your clone is hiding among the crowd, ready to kill you when you\u2019re at your most vulnerable. Search for weapons, be aware of your limited ammo, and carefully examine the hundreds of faces around you to identify your clone. Make sure to watch your back \u2013 danger lurks around every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538290/extras/GameloopCropped.gif?t=1744207892\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Threats, Enemies, and Biological Horrors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through this roguelite experience, unlocking new tactics to survive each threat you encounter. As you advance through the story, new dangers, enemies, and challenges wait to test you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538290/extras/TrucksCropped.gif?t=1744207892\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s Behind These Mysterious Clones?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a strange, dystopian reality to uncover the story behind the clones. Reveal the truth about these mysterious imposters as you fight for the very survival of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2538290?t=1744207892","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2538290?t=1744207892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538290/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744207892","capsule_imagev5":"https